From: Active ESL <engineering@active-esl.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] apparmor: allow generated Waydroid property updates

The Waydroid container manager writes the generated property file after the
LXC profile is attached. Android 16 otherwise receives a read-only property
file, preventing the platform service and graphical session from starting.

---
 data/configs/apparmor_profiles/lxc-waydroid | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/data/configs/apparmor_profiles/lxc-waydroid b/data/configs/apparmor_profiles/lxc-waydroid
--- a/data/configs/apparmor_profiles/lxc-waydroid
+++ b/data/configs/apparmor_profiles/lxc-waydroid
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ profile lxc-waydroid flags=(attach_disconnected, mediate_deleted) {
   /tmp** rw,
   /var** rw,
   /run** rw,
+  /vendor/waydroid.prop rw,
   /mnt** rw,
   /apex** rwk,
   /sbin** rw,
--
2.43.0
